          "path": "_m/g/b/y/r/old-lower-lighthouse-wp/portland-bill-white-houses-and.jpg",
          "filename": "Portland Bill - white houses and old lighthouse (7223499504).jpg",
          "caption": "After we left Weymouth, we went to the Isle of Portland, mainly to go to the lighthouse at Portland Bill.\nWe may have gone when I was little, but back then the lighthouse was closed. This time it was open.\nThe island (well it's not really an island as it is connected by a land bridge to the rest of Dorset) is where the famous Portland Stone comes from.\n\nWhite houses and old lighthouse",
          "alt": "After we left Weymouth, we went to the Isle of Portland, mainly to go to the lighthouse at Portland Bill.\nWe may have gone when I was little, but back then the lighthouse was closed. This time it was open.\nThe island (well it's not really an island as it is connected by a land bridge to the rest of Dorset) is where the famous Portland Stone comes from.\n\nWhite houses and old lighthouse",
          "width": 3648,
